      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BIT UNSURE (1) is yet to miss the placings here in an excellent record which boasts three wins. Was out of placings last time (20.70) at Capalaba in a Restricted WIN, finishing eighth and beaten 13 lengths. Looks suited and should go close. SATISFIED (2) was a brilliant winner two back scoring by 6 lengths but drifted back latest and safely held when 7th and beaten 11 lengths at Q Lakeside (26.06). Comes out of a hot form race last start. Has ability and can measure up. GO WHISKEY GO (8) was safely held last time out, finishing seventh at this track over 300m behind Uncle Joe (17.14) in a Grade 5. Was in the money the start prior. Key player if finds best. VERY SHREWD (3) can fill a top-three spot.",
